DeleteSharesResponse.description:
What a batch delete did, share by share.

Never all-or-nothing. A client keeps the failed ones selected for a retry;
only the codes listed in `deleted` are gone.

expires_in_minutes.description:
The same in minutes, for a lifetime shorter than an hour. At least 1;
`null` means it stops expiring. Send this or `expires_in_hours`, not
both.

members.description:
How many accounts are in it.

What an operator wants before editing. Changing an empty role is free;
changing one held by forty accounts is not.
